<title>USA: Fidelity Select Fund manager Richardson resigns.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Select Fund manager Richardson resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Investments said on Monday that Kevin Richardson, manager of the Select Air Transportation Fund and the Select Defense &amp; Transportation Fund, will leave the company.</p>
<p>A Fidelity spokeswoman said Richardson quit to work for a hedge fund, but she had no further information.</p>
<p>Peter Saperstone will take over management of the two funds and will continue to manage the Select Construction &amp; Housing Fund.</p>
<p>((Boston bureau, (617) 367-4106))</p>
